Chapter: BrowserClipKernels
  cites Gpu chapter DeviceEffect

 We say:

 Packed f16 projection transposition writes a whole pair per thread.

  bcx-half : Integer, Integer -> [Device] Integer
  bcx-half (src) (i) = bit-and (bit-shru (device-load src (i / 2)) ((i - i / 2 * 2) * 16)) 65535

  bcx-transpose : Integer, Integer, Integer, Integer -> [Device] Integer
  bcx-transpose (src) (dst) (d) (gid) =
    if gid >= d * d / 2 then 0
    else let i = gid * 2
    in let a = (i - i / d * d) * d + i / d
    in let b = (i + 1 - (i + 1) / d * d) * d + (i + 1) / d
    in device-store dst gid (bit-or (bcx-half src a) (bit-shl (bcx-half src b) 16))
